Dear all,

A follow-up question on the max.time argument.
I'm looking for the default setting of max.time. Does anyone know where I can find this?

Thanks!

Sanne

On Monday, 4 December 2017 05:07:07 UTC+1, Ed Merkle wrote:

> Menglin,
>
> I think you can use the argument
>
> jagcontrol=list(max.time="5m")
>
> where the "5m" stands for 5 minutes (so you can set it to anything). You could also use letters s/h/d/w for "seconds"/"hours"/"days"/"weeks". This all comes from autorun.jags() in the runjags package; blavaan just passes the max.time argument off to autorun.jags().
>
> Ed
>
>
>

